# Turning off special handling of INBOX in the settings window lists it among the projects at once, focused while the pane is zoomed into it.
size 100 30
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Call mom
Work:
	- Report
END
keys gi g,
type /inbox
keys <Enter> <Enter>
see off
keys <Esc> <Esc> <C-g>
see Projects
see │▌ INBOX                                     1 │
hide 󰚇
keys <Esc> gi
status No INBOX project in the Navigator
quit
